      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should get help or whatever but it feels like such a performance. like, what am i even supposed to tell a therapist? that my life is over because of a server error? it sounds so stupid when i say it out loud, but it doesn't feel stupid. it feels final. there's no version of the future where i get this back. i just see a long, empty, humiliating stretch of time where i have to pretend i'm still someone. i just want the noise to stop. i want to just... not have to be this person anymore.",
